<title>DENMARK: Danish NKT six-month 96 profit diminishes.</title>
<headline>Danish NKT six-month 96 profit diminishes.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30,1996</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result	     69.7   vs 114.7</p>
<p> Grpoup operating result	    89   vs 135</p>
<p> Group net turnover		2,349   vs 2,295</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish wire and cable maker is NKT Holding A/S. It said in a statement it expected full year 1996 operating profits in excess of 1995's 138 million crowns, coupled with better turnover and an improved performance by its troubled Nilfisk vacuum cleaner unit following rationalisation.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969650</p>
